        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: సంకోచించు",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "సంకోచించు — saṅkōciñcu — \"to hold back; to hesitate\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఆమె నిజం చెప్పడానికి సంకోచించింది. āme nijaṁ ceppaḍāniki saṅkōciñcindi. She hesitated to tell the truth."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): సంకోచించాను, saṅkōciñcānu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What you hesitate over takes -డానికి. Close to వెనకాడు, which you know."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "సంకోచించు (saṅkōciñcu) is built on Sanskrit saṁkoca, \"contraction, shrinking; shyness\" (Monier-Williams), with the Telugu verb ending -ఇంచు."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
            }
          ]
        },
